{
  "id": "EXO.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Okong’anya 23",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ayare oboronge na amaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa gosiarera oborimo, na tobaisa gokengera omokori amabe ase okomobera kirori bw’oborimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koba ensemo y’abare abange kobarigetie gokora amabe, gose tobaisa kobakorera abwo bare abange ogwanchereria na gotanga oboronge ase okoba kirori bw’okoonchorana oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa gwanchereria omonto omotaka ase ekiina kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oise korora eng’ombe y’omobisa oo gose etigere yaye egosira goika omoyeiranerie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korarore etigere y’oyo okogechete yagure negurube ebogoretie, tobaisa koyeetania, korende oyekonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa korina omonto omotaka oboronge bwaye, ekero ekiina kiaye gekogambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwetange kegima korwa ase oborimo, na tobaisa kogera omonyaboronge aitwe, ekiagera inche Omonene tingotiga koa omomochi egesusuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa gwancha oegwe riaaki, ekiagera riaaki nigo rikoukoria omonto erinde takorora ayare boronge; naende nigo rigosaria ekiina ki’abanyene oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa gokorera omomenyi bobe, naki inwe momanyete buna omomenyi akoigwa ase enkoro yaye, ekiagera nainwe abanyene mwarenge abamenyi ase ense ya Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwaka o gatano na kabere, ne rituko ria gatano na kabere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase emiaka etano nomo osimeke na kobusura endagera, na ogese ebiamire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende omwaka o gatano na kabere otige omogondo otimoke, toremwa, korende ebirakine na kwama ase omogondo obitigere abataka, na ebi baratigarie bibe endagera ye ching’iti chi’orosaana. Okore boigo nomogondo oo bw’emesabibu na oyo bw’emezeituni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase amatuko atano na rimo okore emeremo yao, korende ase rituko ria gatano na kabere otimoke, na eng’ombe yao na etigere yao nachirochio chitimoke; naboigo nomosomba oo omomura oiboreire bwoo, na omomenyi oo, nabarabwo batimoke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Motegerere mono onsi aya nabateebirie na moyabwate. Timwatora amarieta ye chinyasae chinde; ayio taigugwa korwa ase emenwa yaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amatuko Amanene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Okong’ 34:18-26; Okoir 16:1-17)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kera omwaka nobe kogontwarera Amatuko Amanene ara gatato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi bwa Abibu, omotienyi oyio mwaruete ase ense ya Misiri, Goika orende Rituko Rinene ri’Emegati etabekiri memera ase enchera eyio nagochigeete. Naboigo orie emegati etabekiri memera ase amatuko atano na abere buna nagochigeete. Na monto onde tabaisa gocha ase obosio bwane namaboko amasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende goika orende Rituko Rinene rie Rigesa ekero okogesa ogotongora gw’okwama kw’omogondo oo gwasimegete na ogakora emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Orende boigo Rituko Rinene ri’Ogosangereria Rigesa ri’omoerio bw’omwaka ekero ogosangereria okwama kw’emeremo yao emekong’u gwakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara gatato kera omwaka abanto bao abasacha babe bagocha ase obosio bwane, inche Omonene Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa kondetera amanyinga ’ekeng’wanso amo nomogati obekire ememera. Ebitinya bie chinyama echi nkoruerwa ekeng’wanso ase rituko riane rinene, tibitigara goika bokie rituko rikobwatia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Goika orente ogotongora okore okuya korwa ase omogondo oo, ase enyomba yane inche Omonene Nyasae oo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa koiyekera emanwa y’embori ime y’amabeere ’eng’ina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chiira na amatebererio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nintome omomalaika agotang’ane na gokorenda ase enchera, agoikie aase aria nakoroiseirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende ase obosio bwaye, na moigwere aya arabateebie. Tobaisa kwanga komoigwera, ere takomoororera amaabera oyoramoche koigwera ekiagera erieta riane nigo rire ime yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende koramoigwere ere, na gokora ayio onsi nakwanire inche, rirorio nindwanie ababisa bao, ninchande abwo bakogochanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki omomalaika one nagotang’ane akoire na kogoikia ase ense y’Abaamori, na Abahiti, na Abaperisi, na Abakanaani, na Abahivi, na Abayebusi, na inche nimbasirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timosasiima chinyasae chiabo, gose gochikorera; na timokora buna abanto abwo bagokora, korende mosirie kegima emegwekano yabo y’ogosasimwa na moyaiyerie inse amagena abo onsi are aase bagosasimera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Momokorere Omonene Nyasae oino, na inche ninsesenie endagera yaino na amaache aino, nindusie amarwaire ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ense yaino mokuungu onde tari oborito bwaye boragwe, gose onde takoba omogomba; nimbae obogima obotambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nintang’anie okwoboyia kwane bosio bwaino, na goichanie na gotantania abanto bonsi abwo morabe mokoumerana nabarabwo; ninkore ababisa baino bonsi baonchoke batame korwa ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintome ebiaramba birase na goseria Abahivi, na Abakanaani, na Abahiti, korwa ase Kaanani bosio bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinkobaseria ase omwaka oyomo, ense ebaise koba bosa, ne ching’iti chi’orosana chimenteke chibachande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo ndabaserie ng’ora ng’ora goika momenteke moisane komenya ense eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche ninkobekere orobebe rwao gochakera Enyancha Embariri goikera Enyancha y’Abafilisti, naende korwa ase erooro goika orooche rwa Eufarati, ekiagera nimbeke ababiare b’ense eyio ase amaboko aino, na inwe mobaseerie, batame korwa ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa gokora okobwatana konde gwonsi nabarabwo, gose ne chinyasae chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo tibaamenya ase ense yao, baabaise kogera onkorere ebibe. Onye kogokorera chinyasae chiabo, chirochio nachinyare kogotega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
